Cc: rajanv@xilinx.com, devicetree@vger.kernel.org, linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, Rajan Vaja <rajan.vaja@xilinx.com>, Jolly Shah <jollys@xilinx.com>
